 W(1, WHAT, '`visits = ["Pune", "Goa", "Pune", "Delhi", "Goa"]`. Use `set()` to print how many different cities there are.', 'visits = ["Pune", "Goa", "Pune", "Delhi", "Goa"]\n', 'visits = ["Pune", "Goa", "Pune", "Delhi", "Goa"]\nprint(len(set(visits)))', "`set()` drops the repeats, and `len()` counts what is left."),
